# 🧮 Scientific Calculator with Error Analysis & Numerical Methods

A modern web-based scientific calculator that combines advanced mathematical computations, error analysis, and numerical root-finding algorithms into one interactive application.

## 📸 Project Preview

> Replace `project-preview.png` with your actual screenshot file.

