## 📦 Installation

Clone the repository:

```bash
git clone https://github.com/ANJx24/errorcalculatorweb.git
```

Navigate into the project:

```bash
cd errorcalculatorweb
```

Install dependencies (if required):

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

Run the project:

```bash
python app.py
```

